ank\">3</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2758-errol216","name":"Errol216","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2758_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-19T15:03:12-07:00","id":954055,"title":"","content":"Elisabeth<br /> A Osiran on a mission Elisabeth will not stop until every single monster who murdered her throng will be vanquished<br /> <img src=\"http://s2.glbimg.com/ugLMvOkCXRKR9V5lRfa4c_4byOE=/0x0:720x900/690x0/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_e84042ef78cb4708aeebdf1c68c6cbd6/internal_photos/apis/a3ab2163341a47d6ba51c6124ef8db6e/cleo-pires-jmj.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> Once more i bring a actress from my homeland to portray the hunter,Cleo Pires is her name","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-20T13:09:14-07:00","id":954568,"title":"","content":"Tammuz<br /> <br /> <i>Gillian</i><br /> Many prometheans are fascinated by human emotions and philoshopies,Gillian goes the other way round. She loves buildings,the same way most of us love books,buildings are a way for her to understand humans. To learn about them,to show tar process i've picked<br /> <img src=\"https://pmcdeadline2.files.wordpress.com/2015/05/emily-vancamp.jpg?w=446&amp;h=299&amp;crop=1\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> Emily Vancamp!<br /> <br /> <i>Todd</i><br /> Todd is dealing with a lot of speech impedement right now,if they ever do a Promethean Tv show it'd be nice to have him as a character i feel like lots of people may relate to him.<br /> <img src=\"https://s-media-cache-ak0.pinimg.com/236x/6e/31/80/6e31805a2edb330c30f9101aa0749c29.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> I feel like Luke Able would be the guy to pick<br /> <br /> Senka<br /> Another promethean that misses a life she never actually lived,Senka looks like a cheerleader because she was made from one. And she feel sad about how she just can't go out with other young people and be a teen,if you ask me. being a teen is bloody overrated. however she's still a very worty character<img src=\"http://www.kpopmusic.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/10/Sunmi-3.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> I've picked the pop singer Lee Sunmi for the role<br /> <br /> <i>Agammenon</i><br /> <br /> This one has a ironic name,Agammenon was a powerful king and warlord on ancient world. But this Agammenon is the very image of a lost soul. But he's also On A Mission so he's pretty determined as a result.<br /> <img src=\"http://i.telegraph.co.uk/multimedia/archive/02186/summ-image_2186753b.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> Let's hope Gary Oldman it's up To The Mission.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-20T13:10:37-07:00","id":954570,"title":"","content":"<i>Vasily</i><br /> He's our gentle giant. Vasily is,a big guy who barely speaks louder than a wimper and just doest want to fuck with no one. A Meek yet loving fellow kinda like....<br /> <img src=\"http://assets.schwarzenegger.com/images/img-2.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> Arnold himself!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-22T10:48:19-07:00","id":955698,"title":"","content":"You gotta cast Tommy Wiseau as someone.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-22T11:47:20-07:00","id":955758,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/953932-let-s-cast-them-created?p=955698#post955698\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You gotta cast Tommy Wiseau as someone.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'll do. glad to have you back btw","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-22T12:46:29-07:00","id":955814,"title":"","content":"Ulgans.<br /> <br /> <i>Jonesy</i><br /> He reminds me a bit from a world of darkness character,Mictlantechli the Wanderer from VTM,more specially Diablerie:Mexixo. Like Mictlantechli Jonesy feels lonely on account of being a monster. And he manages that by travelling ,trying to find people to like him. And above all trying to Learn,to become more until he finally become the best he can possibly be. a human being<br /> <img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e6/James_Dean_in_Rebel_Without_a_Cause.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> He may not be rebbelious as our james dean,but he is looking for a new cause<br /> <br /> <i>Old Woman.</i><br /> <br /> This one is a cliche if i ever saw one,and i bloody love some cliches. She is the archetypal old woman in the edge of village helping people with their spooky problems. She seems to deal more easily with the spirits than most Ulgan,maybe they just like her? Well,i know one face it's pretty likeable<br /> <img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2029688967/Betty_Photo.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> You can't say no to betty white spiritis.<br /> <br /> <i>Nicole</i><br /> Hey,another character withe almost the same ass myself? undestable my name is AWESOME. Nicki here like Catherine the Great loves herself some horses. Apparently she has a deal with some spirits,And apparently she just want them to help her horses be better. kinda weird but no more that any promethean,i do wonder if she can ride well<br /> <img src=\"http://thumb.tvpalace.org/actor/annie-hall/w75_1eLe.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> And i think anyone knows horses better than Allison Brie<br /> <br /> <i>Driscoll</i><br /> <br /> I'm surprised one of the Ulgan has that name,it sounds so cyhberpunk for someone who exorcizes spirits. Driscoll is supposed to look like a Quack,but end up having people trust him because of his demeanon, i can think of another professional who's like that<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://www.nerdist.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/01/ce1.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> Does any possed folks need a doctor?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-25T09:29:42-07:00","id":957659,"title":"","content":"<i>Tara</i><br /> Another ulgan that it's SO done with the spirit's murdering folks,Tara just about had it . and i can think of someone who already played a similar character<br /> <img src=\"http://img2.timeinc.net/people/i/2009/database/sarahmichellegellar/sarah-michelle-gellar-300.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> There's just something about a brunette bufffy that screams Ulgan to me","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-25T18:05:05-07:00","id":957960,"title":"","content":"<b>Unfleshed</b>.<br /> <br /> <i>Freda</i><br /> Freda would be a enormously challenging character to play in a movie,she literraly has a software for a brain,she used to be a program to understand people in psychological level,and now she's a promethean capable of understanding,except how to be a person. a Actress would have to be pretty kickass so be able to portray such dichotomy,with that in mind i've seeked the girl i personally i think would be up to the job<br /> <img src=\"http://cdn.images.express.co.uk/img/dynamic/79/590x/450145658-483355.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> do i even need who she is?<br /> <br /> Ki<br /> Ki,the paper man,manufactured to be the protector,to help people. He fascinates me as character,a warrior made of paper ? who could play this guy? it took me a while but i believe this one man from dusk till dawn fame could do it<br /> <img src=\"http://vignette3.wikia.nocookie.net/dcanimatedmovieuniverse/images/f/f4/Brandon_Soo_Hoo.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20160625230329\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <i>Ivan</i><br /> Ivan just screams BADASS to me,he reminds me of Android16 from Dragon Ball z,a killing machine with the terryfying coldness of a bullet in flight brought to life by his demiurge Awful Will. In a mission to try to find within himself the capacity for compassion<br /> <img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/424184673938329600/FArA372x_400x400.jpeg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> Muhammad ali was an an amazing father and a good man,but he never was a nice person<br /> <br /> <i>Ila</i><br /> A chatbot suddenly come alive? jesus, poor Ila,i'm surprised she didn't just decide humanity it's not worth it after spending such a long time in the internet. i admire her fiber,she didn't ever get a physical body like the others,she had to build one from scratch,you gotta respect that. i picture as a person with kind features,while in the Mask of course<br /> <img src=\"http://www3.pictures.zimbio.com/bg/Bojana+Novakovic+Edge+Darkness+Premiere+0_YNIeunyFil.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/> <br /> Bojana Novakovic has the face i was looking for!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-28T07:12:58-07:00","id":959224,"title":"","content":"I don't really imagine Combo (or Chicago) as looking attractive. I mean, it's understandable to want to &quot;cast&quot; a nonbinary--or in Combo's case hermaphrodite--character as someone androgynous, but zie <i>is</i> a Wretched after all (also the first Promethean to really hammer home for me how fucked up it is to be made from multiple corpses). Conversely, Niccolai does seem like he'd be beautiful and androgynous to me, but that's probably my own biases.<br /> I'm on the fence about Joan Jett as Alice. She's certainly a badass and has a similar personality, but Alice was is a slight little 50s housewife turned punk. Then again, Joan Jett is only as tall as I am. She's got the presence of someone at least 5'10. (I don't actually have any &quot;I agree&quot; comments; I just wanted to be picky about the characters I like, I don't remember most of the others, and don't know some of the actors)<br /> <br /> I definitely agree that Tommy Weissau is clearly a Promethean. Although that isn't Allison Brie (Google says Annie Hall). I certainly would like to see some of these actors playing Prometheans, though.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar269_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"269\" data-vbnamecard=\"269\">Charlaquin</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2861-nyx\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar2861_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2861\" data-vbnamecard=\"2861\">Nyx</a> Huh. TIL. I don't have a career that's threatened, but I can relate. Good luck on working that out.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my first Storyteller's Vault product: <a href=\"http://www.storytellersvault.com/product/438661/Pretty-Guardian-Faerie-Knights-A-Hunter-the-Vigil-Conspiracy\" target=