t.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-28T09:21:25-07:00","id":959300,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar269_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"269\" data-vbnamecard=\"269\">Charlaquin</a> Well, yes, I'm aware of that, but Combo is <i>literally</i> a hermaphrodite, formed from the corpses of different sexes. It goes a bit beyond even chimerism for zir.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my first Storyteller's Vault product: <a href=\"http://www.storytellersvault.com/product/438661/Pretty-Guardian-Faerie-Knights-A-Hunter-the-Vigil-Conspiracy\" target=\"_blank\">Pretty Guardian Faerie Knights</a><br /> Currently working on <b>Night Horrors: Pushing Daisies</b>. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1517001-%F0%9F%91%BB-a-handful-of-sample-geists\" target=\"_blank\">Sample here</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2998-aspel","name":"Aspel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2998_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"403"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-01T13:30:57-07:00","id":961868,"title":"","content":"<b>Extemporae</b><br /> <br /> <i>Nuada</i><br /> I already knew Nuada would be awesome when i saw his name,he was named after a legendary irish king (or irish god depending on whom you ask). And also,he has like,a bloody balck hole inside him,how do promethean writes come up with that? anyways,there only one irish actor awesome enough....<br /> <img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fe/Liam_Neeson_Deauville_2012_2.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> Where do you think he picked all those skills<br /> <br /> <i>Eris</i><br /> Another one i admire a lot Eris has a very firm sense of right and wrong. we need more peole like this,that just won't rest until what they see as evil is brought down. nof course eris is not always right... Besides that. She's an Miss Sunshine,granted life not by an Demiurge's Unholy Will,but by an terrible solar explosion. and there's the is girl that makes me thin of the Sun...<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://s1.favim.com/orig/11/angel-dress-fearless-singer-swift-Favim.com-177464.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> Fearles as ever,TayTay.<br /> <br /> <i>Miko</i><br /> Miko is a hard one,she was give life by the Sea,and it's hard to pick up someone who is see like. However,the sea is quite ruthless. at least where i come from. and there is one woman that just looks ruthless to me...<br /> <img src=\"http://media.tumblr.com/3109d0f39a9aad3ada3d2cd0aff915c0/tumblr_inline_mhrnirg5iY1qz4rgp.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> The doctor is in<br /> <br /> <i>Snow</i><br /> Snow is cold,his phlegtmatic and doesn't really understands himself. he has many of the traits that define a Created,just like an certain actor<br /> <img src=\"http://www.justpressplay.net/images/stories/the_room/TommyWiseau.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> Y'all see this coming didnt ya ?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-01T23:26:44-07:00","id":962125,"title":"","content":"John C. Reilly is another one I'd cast, but none of the existing characters would be as perfect as Dr. Brule. I will forever consider him as the perfect Aurum Promethean.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}